      ],
      "source": "https://www.bradfordcountypa.gov/212/LeRaysville-Borough"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Local farmers supply the LeRaysville Cheese Factory, where Amish‑style cheese is still made from regional milk.",
